OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1764356793
OL,3,CFormer gymnastics coach jailed over
OL,4,Cindecent 'deepfake' images of children
OL,6,FA former gymnastics coach has been
OL,7,Fjailed for creating indecent images of
OL,8,Fchildren - including using "deepfake"
OL,9,Ftech to superimpose a child's head on
OL,10,Fto a naked body.
OL,12,FThomas Verdicchio was reported to
OL,13,Fpolice by British Gymnastics, which
OL,14,Fsaid it was committed to making "our
OL,15,Fsport a hostile place for anyone"
OL,16,Fcommitting similar offences.
OL,18,FThe 24-year-old was arrested in
OL,19,FOctober last year and officers seized
OL,20,Fhis mobile phone, iPad and a laptop.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
