PN,30902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1764356793
OL,3,CFormer gymnastics coach jailed over
OL,4,Cindecent 'deepfake' images of children
OL,6,FThey were found to contain two
OL,7,F"category B" videos and 15 "category C
OL,8,Fphotographs".
OL,10,FCambridgeshire Police said some of the
OL,11,Fimages had been digitally manipulated
OL,12,Fusing "deepfake" technology to
OL,13,Fsuperimpose a child's head on to a
OL,14,Fnude body.
OL,16,FVerdicchio, of Seathwaite, Huntingdon,
OL,17,Fpleaded guilty to four counts of
OL,18,Fmaking indecent photographs or pseudo-
OL,19,Fphotographs of a child at a hearing
OL,20,Flast month.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1764356793
OL,3,CFormer gymnastics coach jailed over
OL,4,Cindecent 'deepfake' images of children
OL,6,FHe was later jailed for one year and
OL,7,F10 months at Cambridge Crown Court and
OL,8,Fgiven a sexual harm prevention order
OL,9,Fwhich will last for 10 years.
OL,11,FDet Con Daniel Knight, of
OL,12,FCambridgeshire Police, said:
OL,13,F"Verdicchio was fully aware his
OL,14,Factions were wrong, and he betrayed
OL,15,Fthe trust placed in him by the
OL,16,Fcommunity.
OL,18,F"He poses a serious threat to
OL,19,Fchildren, and had he not been caught,
OL,20,Fhis crimes could have escalated into
OL,21,Fcontact offences."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,310,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1764356793
OL,3,CFormer gymnastics coach jailed over
OL,4,Cindecent 'deepfake' images of children
OL,6,FBritish Gymnastics confirmed
OL,7,FVerdicchio was a registered member and
OL,8,Fcoach who had taken coaching
OL,9,Fqualifications delivered by the
OL,10,Forganisations.
OL,12,FHe had attended Huntingdon Gymnastics
OL,13,FClub as a child but had not worked
OL,14,Fthere, a spokesman said.
OL,16,FThey urged anyone with safeguarding
OL,17,Fconcerns to contact police immediately.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/5
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
