PN,30905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F309A1764356793
OL,3,CFormer gymnastics coach jailed over
OL,4,Cindecent 'deepfake' images of children
OL,6,F"As soon as these criminal offences
OL,7,Fwere brought to our attention we made
OL,8,Fa referral to the statutory
OL,9,Fauthorities, and justice has now been
OL,10,Fserved," the spokesman added.
OL,12,F"The measures we have put in place are
OL,13,Fthere to make our sport a hostile
OL,14,Fplace for anyone who may want to
OL,15,Fcommit such offences, and our
OL,16,Freporting mechanisms meant this
OL,17,Findividual was caught and punished,
OL,18,Fensuring his crimes could not escalate
OL,19,Finto contact offences. "
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/5
